    "updated_at": "2021-12-03T18:16:08Z",
    "body": "Right, I'm saying this is not a correct impression. userInitiated applies to all navigations causes by clicking on links or submitting forms, and to zero navigations caused by navigate(). And all navigations can have duration once you use app history, including pushState() ones.\r\n\r\nI'm OK with any venue for discussion.",
