    "updated_at": "2023-07-31T12:18:03Z",
    "body": "I think that this can be done differently, entirely within the Performance Timeline API with less intrusion into HTML's navigation algorithms. I've updated https://github.com/w3c/performance-timeline/pull/192, and I'll close this for now.",
